body: "## Trust boundary\n\n- Discover and pin authorization-server issuer identity before persisting or redeeming credentials.\n- Validate a returned iss value and never reuse credentials across issuers.\n- Send an appropriate application_type and prefer Client ID Metadata Documents over deprecated dynamic registration.\n- Make consent scopes align with pm read, mutation, workspace, extension, task, and resource authority.\n- Validate transport headers and custom x-mcp-header mappings against injection, confused deputy, SSRF, replay, downgrade, and proxy-cache threats.\n- Propagate traceparent, tracestate, and baggage only through allowlisted metadata with privacy limits and redaction.\n- Keep stdio local trust behavior distinct from remote HTTP authorization rather than silently treating one as the other."
